<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan bank gets 1.13 bln rupees in operation.</title>
<headline>Pakistan bank gets 1.13 bln rupees in operation.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said it had accepted 1.13 billion rupees in its weekly open market operation in Short-Term Federal Bonds on Wednesday.</p>
<p>		     Offered    Accepted    Max cut-off</p>
<p>Outright sale   1.13 bln    1.13 bln    17.29 pct/yr</p>
<p>($1=40.22 rupees) -- Amir Zia 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
